    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nRural Support Services of Latvian Land Registry maintains and updates geospatial information on a daily basis. We adopted the latest dataset for field boundaries from the official source for the year 2021.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [Euro Crops](https://github.com/maja601/EuroCrops/wiki/Latvia)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [Rural Support Service](https://www.lad.gov.lv/lv/lauku-registra-dati)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** CC-BY-NC-4.0\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Dataset Validity:** 2021\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |\r\n| area                      | float     |\r\n| perimeter                 | float     |\r\n| crop_id                   | int64     |\r\n| crop_name                 | string    |"
  },
